{"type":"text","timestamp":1790458787469,"sessionID":"ses_f205d8eecffe10MJiDyzx0juLE","part":{"id":"prt_0dfa8f675001QuoAz2rUFlqWqx","messageID":"msg_0dfa8815b001F13quPyv7hMBqb","sessionID":"ses_f205d8eecffe10MJiDyzx0juLE","type":"text","text":"Maximum steps for this agent have been reached. Here is a summary of the work completed and what remains.\n\n## Work completed\n\n1. **Rotated the Level node** — `rotation = 0.22` is set on the `Level` node in `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn` (it was already present and confirmed unchanged).\n\n2. **Detected the six yellow star coins** — Wrote custom pure-Python image analysis (no numpy available; pip blocked by proxy) on `assets/sprites/platformer.jpg` (529×350). Connected-component analysis with a yellow threshold, fragment merging, rim-pixel circle fitting, and a saturation-weighted centroid correction produced these tight-fit centers in texture (Level-local) space:\n   - Coin 1: (287.35, 298.34) — bottom, middle\n   - Coin 2: (254.58, 312.37) — bottom, left\n   - Coin 3: (284.03, 111.98) — green pipe, middle\n   - Coin 4: (426.05, 72.92) — top-right pipe\n   - Coin 5: (319.42, 83.88) — platform below Lakitu\n   - Coin 6: (288.32, 187.55) — left of Mario\n   - Radius determined: ~11 px (coin star outlines measure ~11–13 px; visual annotation confirmed r=11 covers each star with minimal spill).\n\n3. **Added `CoinHighlights` Node2D under `Level`**, containing six `Polygon2D` nodes named `CoinHighlight1`–`CoinHighlight6`, each a 12-vertex regular polygon (r = 11 px) centered on its coin, with `color = Color(1, 1, 0, 0.35)` (semi-transparent yellow). The scene file `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn` was fully rewritten with these nodes.\n\n4. **Partial verification** — A headless render of the scene (`render00000001.png`) was produced and visually inspected: the rotated platformer scene shows all six highlights roughly centered on the six yellow star coins.\n\n## Remaining tasks\n\n- **Fine alignment check (optional polish)**: The highlights appear correctly placed, though a pixel-perfect check of centering at higher resolution was in progress when the step limit hit. The final annotated verification render at higher resolution was not completed (the last command failed only due to a missing file extension `/tmp/opencode/hd` → should be `/tmp/opencode/hd.png`; purely a verification artifact, not a project issue).\n\n## Recommendations\n\n- Optionally run one more verification pass: `timeout 30 /run/gamedevbench-bin/godot --path /workspace --quit-after 2 --write-movie /tmp/opencode/hd.png` and inspect the frames to confirm each highlight exactly covers its coin. If any center looks off by 1–2 px, shift that polygon's coordinates by the observed delta in Level-local space (divide screen-space delta by the 0.75 scale and rotate by −0.22 rad).\n- The scene file itself is complete and syntactically valid; the primary task requirements (rotation 0.22 rad, CoinHighlights node, six tight semi-transparent circular Polygon2D highlights over the six coins) are implemented in `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`.","time":{"start":1790458787445,"end":1790458787450},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_abf3ffe92e8e4d3da0f1c4506c3dad2b_msg"}}}}
